data floor_discovery_dissolve_trigger: String = "🟡 dissolve-on: floor_discovery_hand_rust_bridge — floor_discovery_producer.dag is roster authority; Rust host still realizes effect-reach reclassification (apply_effect_reach_derived_reads_live_tree), parallel tree walks for build_floor_lens_import_graph, and invoke_floor_discovery_producer interpreter transport via discover_floor_witness_roster; DISSOLVES WHEN discovery admission consumes v2.lens.effect_reach directly and lens-graph feed the .dag producer closure (witness: dag/test/claim/floor_discovery_hand_rust_equivalence_witness_test.dag). Legacy discover_floor_corpus_rows_inner_rust_legacy deleted; discover_floor_corpus_rows / check_floor_filename_hygiene / _inner / _scoped arms deleted."

