data floor_discovery_scope_semantics_note: String = "discovery_scope_dirs semantics (intentional, review 41826): the producer walk (floor_discovery_walk_dir over all source_roots) applies tree-wide hygiene — filename __ refusal, test-marked-decl sidecar, wire-contract sidecar — before finalize. discover_floor_witness_roster applies discovery_scope_dirs only as a post-walk row filter (cli_run.rs apply_discovery_scope_dirs_filter), not as a pre-walk skip. Legacy build_floor_lens_hygiene_graph short-circuited sidecar checks outside scope; the new shape refuses on any hygiene violation anywhere under source_roots even when witness enrollment is scoped. Today ci_floor_plan discovery_scope_dirs is always [] so production CI is unchanged; non-empty scope is for narrowed roster projection only, not narrowed hygiene."
